    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always been a dual experience for me—both challenging and deeply rewarding. I find beauty in its abstract nature, especially when it intersects with philosophy, which is one of my favorite subjects. However, my lower secondary education left gaps that still haunt me, making some concepts feel out of reach despite my passion. It’s a subject where I oscillate between confidence and frustration, but I keep pushing forward.",
