    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "I’ve experimented with AI tools like Khan Academy’s exercises and even some online tutors. The experience was mixed—some explanations were clear and helpful, especially for visualizing concepts, but others felt too abstract or lacked depth. I prefer a balance between AI guidance and human interaction, which is why I still seek help from peers or mentors when stuck.",
